{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53515","headline":"李独携酒见访 · 李涉","name":"李独携酒见访","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晓斋独坐霜景寒，草堂逸士来相干。\n风神左峭心意濶。\n自言山中新醖熟，手挈一壶兼一轴。\n果然文字称仪容，已觉建安风彩俗。\n嗟予潦倒身无成，偶因章句生浮名。\n就中怜爱李景俭，酒狂大语欺奴兵。\n老夫昔逐巴江岸，唱得《竹枝》肠欲断。\n爲君试发一声看，九派烟霞愁漫漫。\n（影印本《诗渊》第一册一三一页）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李涉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53515.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53515","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}